  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"This book was created as part of the Charles H. Watts II History of the Book Program at the John Carter Brown Library, within a masterclass run by Andrew Losowsky, Watts Program Provocateur-in-Residence."--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"On April 9th, 2011, Colin Frazer ... [et al.] gathered together ... in the John D Rockefeller Library at Brown University in Providence, RI ... . We then created a series of ideas for pieces that would identify this book as a printed time capsule ... to be placed inside the library archive at Brown University, and in the repository of the Library of Congress. The book would be a record of the day we spent together, of ourselves, of thie place."--Introd.</subfield>
  </datafield>
